--- !u!114 &897199441
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 897199440}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 81b35d1316d7d564c9e0b151f5545f32, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  audio_Characters: {fileID: 204076877}
  dialogs:
  - dialogsSet:
    - I remember being a child, lost among the thousands of pumpkins on the family
      farm.
    - I no longer know if it was because of the hallucinations, but I always felt
      like I drowned  in a sea.
    - An endless sea... of dots, and colors, and patterns, and even pumpkins, where
      I could lose myself.
  - dialogsSet:
    - "I think I know this place, but something is missing. I don\xB4t feel safe
      here."
    - All this emptiness, all this chaos... I could put an end to it.
    - I only need to immerse in it. Let the patterns take up the surroundings, and
      dissolve myself in this little universe.
  - dialogsSet:
    - The endless expanse of what my mind sees.
    - I feel the loss of my individuality in this infinity that I have created.
    - And in this self-obliteration, as I merge with the whole, suddenly I am free,
      free from the burden of being an individual.
  txtDialogs: {fileID: 1652682931}
  txtIndications: {fileID: 1644629907}
  txtInstructions: {fileID: 895571231}
  timeBetweenLines: 9
  typingSpeed: 0.04
